.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.143.9.008"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.143.9.008", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t011"], "target_head": "t011"}, {"id": "PSA.143.9.a010", "note": "Finite verb with its subject pronoun (rule 17), the infinitive marker its recast English licenses, and the reflexive object the Piel's own sense licenses (rule 44); head on the lexical verb, the unit discontinuous under rule 25.", "source": ["WLC.PSA.143.9.009"], "source_head": "WLC.PSA.143.9.009", "status": "aligned", "target": ["t008", "t012", "t013", "t014"], "target_head": "t013"}], "ref": "PSA.143.9", "review_notes": ["*flee* is the one added unit; the alternative of folding it into `כִסִּתִי` is named in that unit's note."], "source_edition": "ASV-alignment Hebrew projection", "target_edition": "ASV", "variant_decisions": []}
